<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1101] [PATCH] RecommenderServlet: Wrong output when using JSON format </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1101</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When using &quot;json&quot; as format for the RecommenderServlet, the JSON returned is not valid: there is a comma &apos;,&apos; just before the closing bracket of the &quot;item&quot; array.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The fix is trivial: do not add a &apos;,&apos; if the item is the last one.&lt;br/&gt;
Patch is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
